    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area Approx. 56 sqm/ 603 sqft\n\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market, this charming two bedroom end of terrace cottage occupies a wonderful position directly opposite the Hole in the Wall and the entrance to the Phoenix Park one of Dublin`s most sought-after and character filled addresses.\n\nNo.10 offers bright, comfortable living accommodation and benefits from a private side garden, adding valuable outdoor space and further potential to this already appealing home. The Property also benefits from parking, with rear access via a private lane way just off Blackhorse Avenue - a rare and valuable addition in this location. \n\nFor those looking to extend, planning permission is already in place to substantially enlarge the home, offering a fantastic opportunity to create a much larger family home while retaining the cottages original charm. \n\nBlackhorse Avenue is a highly regarded and vibrant residential area, prized for its proximity to the Phoenix Park, excellent local amenities, and easy access to the city centre, Smithfield, and the Luas. This is a rare chance to acquire a home with genuine scope, in a truly unbeatable location.\n\nViewing of this unique home is highly recommended.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall - 1.72m (5'8\") x 4.49m (14'9\")\nwith hard wood flooring & alarm panel.\n\nKitchen - 3.09m (10'2\") x 2.26m (7'5\")\nwith a range of modern floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback. Integrated oven, microwave, gas hob & extractor fan.\n\nLiving Room - 3.26m (10'8\") x 3.31m (10'10\")\nwith hard wood flooring, wood burner fireplace & double doors leading to garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.56m (11'8\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nto rear of property with carpet.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.56m (11'8\") x 2.25m (7'5\")\nto rear of property with carpet.\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.87m (9'5\") x 1.76m (5'9\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with shower attachment.Tiled floor & partially tiled walls.\n\nUtility Room\nPlumbed for washing machine & tumble dryer.\n\nDining Room - 2.06m (6'9\") x 2.26m (7'5\")\nwith hard wood flooring.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Charming 2 Bed cottage with large outdoor space </li><li> Sought after location beside the Phoenix Park </li><li> Excellent potential to extend (PP in place- drawings available on request) </li><li> Off Street Parking </li><li> Close to convenient transport links </li><li> Fantastic amenities on your doorstep</li></ul>"
      },
